# Party banter: Bran and the tactical opinions of a dead man.
dialogue TSC_Banter_HewIsRight

== start ==
_You overhear Madoc and Bran siting the camp, with a third opinion present._

Madoc: Hew says this ground drinks too fast. He wants us higher.

Bran: Hew's right. Higher's drier. I'll take first watch.

Madoc: You always agree with Hew.

Bran: Hew hasn't been wrong yet.

* [Leave them to it.] -> end
